flowchart TD
    %% GitHub Runner CI/CD Pipeline Execution Flow
    %% Converted from PlantUML Activity Diagram with Swimlanes
    
    Start([Start]) --> PR[PR Created/Updated or Workflow Dispatch]
    
    %% Notes for PR trigger
    PR -.-> Note1["`**Note:** 
    - Developer creates/updates PR
    - Manual workflow dispatch
    - Push to main branch`"]
    
    PR --> CheckEnv{Check Environment Protection Rules}
    
    %% Protection Rules Check
    CheckEnv -.-> Note2["`**Environment Protection Check:**
    - Verify prod environment exists
    - Check protection rules configured  
    - Validate ADM team review requirement
    - Ensure admin bypass blocked
    - Confirm deployment branch policies`"]
    
    CheckEnv -->|Invalid| FailWorkflow[Workflow Fails]
    FailWorkflow --> Stop1([Stop])
    
    CheckEnv -->|Valid| CallReusable[Call Reusable Workflow]
    CallReusable -.-> Note3["`**Reusable Workflow:**
    - Extend GitHub Secrets access
    - Pass application-specific parameters`"]
    
    CallReusable --> AllocateRunner[Allocate GitHub Runner]
    AllocateRunner --> ProvisionRunner[Provision Runner Instance]
    
    %% GitHub Runner Section
    subgraph Runner ["🔧 GitHub Runner"]
        direction TB
        RunnerInit[Runner Initialization]
        ConsumeSecrets[Consume GitHub Secrets]
        GenToken[Generate GitHub App Token]
        CheckoutApp[Checkout Application Repository]
        CheckoutAuto[Checkout Reusable Automation Repository]
        LoadParams[Load Application Parameters]
    end
    
    ProvisionRunner --> RunnerInit
    RunnerInit --> ConsumeSecrets
    ConsumeSecrets --> GenToken
    
    GenToken -.-> Note4["`**Security:**
    - Connect to GitHub App
    - Generate authentication token
    - Secure repository access`"]
    
    GenToken --> CheckoutApp
    CheckoutApp -.-> Note5[Download application source code]
    CheckoutApp --> CheckoutAuto
    CheckoutAuto -.-> Note6[Download composite actions & workflows]
    CheckoutAuto --> LoadParams
    LoadParams -.-> Note7[Parse app-specific configuration]
    
    %% Build and Security Section
    subgraph BuildSec ["🔨 Build & Security Scanning"]
        direction TB
        CallBuild[Call Build & Scan Composite Action]
        InstallTools1[Install Tech-Specific Tools]
        RunSCA[Run SCA Scan]
        GenSBOM[Generate SBOM]
        PubSCA[Publish SCA Scan Results]
        EnforceSCA[Enforce SCA Policy]
        RunSAST[Run SAST Scan]
        GenSARIF[Generate SARIF Report]
        PubSAST[Publish SAST Scan Results]
        EnforceSAST[Enforce SAST Policy]
        RestoreDeps[Restore Dependencies]
        BuildApp[Build Application]
        RunTests[Run Unit Tests]
        PubTests[Publish Unit Test Results]
        ValidateTests[Validate Unit Test Coverage]
        CodeSign[Post-Build Code Signing]
        GenManifest[Generate Build Manifest]
        StageArtifacts[Stage, Archive & Publish Artifacts]
    end
    
    LoadParams --> CallBuild
    CallBuild -.-> Note8[Execute composite action from automation repo]
    CallBuild --> InstallTools1
    InstallTools1 -.-> Note9[.NET, Node.js, Java, etc.]
    InstallTools1 --> RunSCA
    RunSCA --> GenSBOM
    GenSBOM --> PubSCA
    PubSCA --> EnforceSCA
    EnforceSCA --> RunSAST
    RunSAST --> GenSARIF
    GenSARIF --> PubSAST
    PubSAST --> EnforceSAST
    EnforceSAST --> RestoreDeps
    RestoreDeps --> BuildApp
    BuildApp --> RunTests
    RunTests --> PubTests
    PubTests --> ValidateTests
    ValidateTests --> CodeSign
    CodeSign --> GenManifest
    GenManifest --> StageArtifacts
    
    %% Build Summary
    StageArtifacts --> CompileBuild[Compile Build Summary]
    CompileBuild --> PostBuild[Post Build Summary to Job Summaries]
    
    PostBuild --> BuildCheck{Build & Security Scans Pass?}
    BuildCheck -->|No| CleanupFail[Cleanup Runner]
    CleanupFail --> ReleaseFail[Release Runner Resources]
    ReleaseFail --> Stop2([Stop])
    
    %% Dev Environment Deployment
    BuildCheck -->|Yes| GenToken2[Generate New Authentication Token]
    GenToken2 --> CheckoutAuto2[Checkout Reusable Automation Repo]
    
    subgraph DevDeploy ["🚀 Dev Environment Deployment"]
        direction TB
        CallDevDeploy[Call Deploy Composite Action - Dev]
        InstallTools2[Install Tech-Specific Tools]
        DownloadArtifacts1[Download, De-archive & Move Artifacts]
        RunMock[Run Mock Tests]
        PubMock[Publish Mock Test Results]
        ValidateMock[Validate Mock Test Coverage]
        LoadSSH1[Load SSH Private Keys from Secrets]
        EstabSSH1[Establish SSH Connection to Dev Server]
    end
    
    CheckoutAuto2 --> CallDevDeploy
    CallDevDeploy -.-> Note10[Execute deployment composite action]
    CallDevDeploy --> InstallTools2
    InstallTools2 --> DownloadArtifacts1
    DownloadArtifacts1 --> RunMock
    RunMock --> PubMock
    PubMock --> ValidateMock
    ValidateMock --> LoadSSH1
    LoadSSH1 -.-> Note11[SSH keys securely retrieved from GitHub Secrets]
    LoadSSH1 --> EstabSSH1
    
    EstabSSH1 -.-> Note12["`**SSH Connection Details:**
    - Key-based authentication
    - Secure tunnel establishment
    - Connection validation`"]
    
    %% Dev Environment Operations
    subgraph DevEnv ["🖥️ Dev Environment Operations"]
        direction TB
        ValidatePrereq1[Validate Deployment Prerequisites]
        CreateBackup1[Create Application Backup]
        TransferPkg1[Transfer Deployment Package]
        PrepareEnv1[Prepare Deployment Environment]
        DeployApp1[Deploy Application]
        StartApp1[Start Application]
        VerifyDeploy1[Verify Deployment]
        RunSmoke1[Run Smoke Tests]
        WarmUp1[Warm Up Application]
        HealthCheck1[Perform Health Checks]
        UpdateStatus1[Update Deployment Status]
        PostCleanup1[Post Deployment Cleanup]
        CloseSSH1[Close SSH Connection]
    end
    
    EstabSSH1 --> ValidatePrereq1
    ValidatePrereq1 -.-> Note13[Executed via SSH on target server]
    ValidatePrereq1 --> CreateBackup1
    CreateBackup1 -.-> Note14[Remote backup via SSH commands]
    CreateBackup1 --> TransferPkg1
    TransferPkg1 -.-> Note15[SCP/SFTP file transfer over SSH]
    TransferPkg1 --> PrepareEnv1
    PrepareEnv1 --> DeployApp1
    DeployApp1 --> StartApp1
    StartApp1 --> VerifyDeploy1
    VerifyDeploy1 -.-> Note16[SSH remote command execution]
    VerifyDeploy1 --> RunSmoke1
    RunSmoke1 --> WarmUp1
    WarmUp1 --> HealthCheck1
    HealthCheck1 --> UpdateStatus1
    UpdateStatus1 --> PostCleanup1
    PostCleanup1 --> CloseSSH1
    CloseSSH1 -.-> Note17[Secure connection cleanup]
    
    CloseSSH1 --> CompileDev[Compile Dev Deploy Summary]
    CompileDev --> PostDev[Post Dev Summary to Job Summaries]
    
    PostDev --> DevCheck{Dev Deployment Success?}
    DevCheck -->|No| CleanupDev[Cleanup & Release Resources]
    CleanupDev --> Stop3([Stop])
    
    %% Test Environment Deployment
    DevCheck -->|Yes| GenToken3[Generate New Authentication Token]
    GenToken3 --> CheckoutAuto3[Checkout Reusable Automation Repo]
    
    subgraph TestDeploy ["🧪 Test Environment Deployment"]
        direction TB
        CallTestDeploy[Call Deploy Composite Action - Test]
        InstallTools3[Install Tech-Specific Tools]
        DownloadArtifacts2[Download, De-archive & Move Artifacts]
        LoadSSH2[Load SSH Private Keys from Secrets]
        EstabSSH2[Establish SSH Connection to Test Server]
    end
    
    CheckoutAuto3 --> CallTestDeploy
    CallTestDeploy --> InstallTools3
    InstallTools3 --> DownloadArtifacts2
    DownloadArtifacts2 --> LoadSSH2
    LoadSSH2 --> EstabSSH2
    
    EstabSSH2 -.-> Note18["`**SSH Connection to Test Environment:**
    - Secure key-based authentication
    - Remote command execution capability
    - File transfer via SCP/SFTP`"]
    
    %% Test Environment Operations
    subgraph TestEnv ["🧪 Test Environment Operations"]
        direction TB
        ValidatePrereq2[Validate Deployment Prerequisites]
        CreateBackup2[Create Application Backup]
        TransferPkg2[Transfer Deployment Package]
        PrepareEnv2[Prepare Deployment Environment]
        DeployApp2[Deploy Application]
        StartApp2[Start Application]
        VerifyDeploy2[Verify Deployment]
        RunSmoke2[Run Smoke Tests]
        WarmUp2[Warm Up Application]
        RunIntegration[Run Integration Tests]
        PubIntegration[Publish Integration Test Results]
        ValidateIntegration[Validate Integration Test Coverage]
        HealthCheck2[Perform Health Checks]
        UpdateStatus2[Update Deployment Status]
        PostCleanup2[Post Deployment Cleanup]
        CloseSSH2[Close SSH Connection]
    end
    
    EstabSSH2 --> ValidatePrereq2
    ValidatePrereq2 --> CreateBackup2
    CreateBackup2 --> TransferPkg2
    TransferPkg2 -.-> Note19[File transfer over SSH tunnel]
    TransferPkg2 --> PrepareEnv2
    PrepareEnv2 --> DeployApp2
    DeployApp2 --> StartApp2
    StartApp2 --> VerifyDeploy2
    VerifyDeploy2 --> RunSmoke2
    RunSmoke2 --> WarmUp2
    WarmUp2 --> RunIntegration
    RunIntegration -.-> Note20[Tests executed via SSH commands]
    RunIntegration --> PubIntegration
    PubIntegration --> ValidateIntegration
    ValidateIntegration --> HealthCheck2
    HealthCheck2 --> UpdateStatus2
    UpdateStatus2 --> PostCleanup2
    PostCleanup2 --> CloseSSH2
    
    CloseSSH2 --> CompileTest[Compile Test Deploy Summary]
    CompileTest --> PostTest[Post Test Summary to Job Summaries]
    
    PostTest --> TestCheck{Test Deployment Success?}
    TestCheck -->|No| CleanupTest[Cleanup & Release Resources]
    CleanupTest --> Stop4([Stop])
    
    %% Staging Environment Deployment
    TestCheck -->|Yes| GenToken4[Generate New Authentication Token]
    GenToken4 --> CheckoutAuto4[Checkout Reusable Automation Repo]
    
    subgraph StagingDeploy ["🎭 Staging Environment Deployment"]
        direction TB
        CallStagingDeploy[Call Deploy Composite Action - Staging]
        InstallTools4[Install Tech-Specific Tools]
        DownloadArtifacts3[Download, De-archive & Move Artifacts]
        LoadSSH3[Load SSH Private Keys from Secrets]
        EstabSSH3[Establish SSH Connection to Staging Server]
    end
    
    CheckoutAuto4 --> CallStagingDeploy
    CallStagingDeploy --> InstallTools4
    InstallTools4 --> DownloadArtifacts3
    DownloadArtifacts3 --> LoadSSH3
    LoadSSH3 --> EstabSSH3
    
    EstabSSH3 -.-> Note21["`**SSH Connection to Staging Environment:**
    - Production-like security protocols
    - Encrypted file transfers
    - Remote performance test execution`"]
    
    %% Staging Environment Operations
    subgraph StagingEnv ["🎭 Staging Environment Operations"]
        direction TB
        ValidatePrereq3[Validate Deployment Prerequisites]
        CompleteCert[Complete Deployment Certification]
        CreateBackup3[Create Application Backup]
        TransferPkg3[Transfer Deployment Package]
        PrepareEnv3[Prepare Deployment Environment]
        DeployApp3[Deploy Application]
        StartApp3[Start Application]
        VerifyDeploy3[Verify Deployment]
        RunSmoke3[Run Smoke Tests]
        WarmUp3[Warm Up Application]
        RunE2E[Run End-to-End Tests]
        PubE2E[Publish End-to-End Test Results]
        ValidateE2E[Validate End-to-End Test Coverage]
        HealthCheck3[Perform Health Checks]
        RunPerf[Run Performance & Load Tests]
        PubPerf[Publish Performance Test Results]
        UpdateStatus3[Update Deployment Status]
        PostCleanup3[Post Deployment Cleanup]
        CloseSSH3[Close SSH Connection]
    end
    
    EstabSSH3 --> ValidatePrereq3
    ValidatePrereq3 --> CompleteCert
    CompleteCert --> CreateBackup3
    CreateBackup3 --> TransferPkg3
    TransferPkg3 -.-> Note22[Secure file transfer via SSH]
    TransferPkg3 --> PrepareEnv3
    PrepareEnv3 --> DeployApp3
    DeployApp3 --> StartApp3
    StartApp3 --> VerifyDeploy3
    VerifyDeploy3 --> RunSmoke3
    RunSmoke3 --> WarmUp3
    WarmUp3 --> RunE2E
    RunE2E -.-> Note23[Comprehensive testing via SSH]
    RunE2E --> PubE2E
    PubE2E --> ValidateE2E
    ValidateE2E --> HealthCheck3
    HealthCheck3 --> RunPerf
    RunPerf -.-> Note24[Load testing executed remotely]
    RunPerf --> PubPerf
    PubPerf --> UpdateStatus3
    UpdateStatus3 --> PostCleanup3
    PostCleanup3 --> CloseSSH3
    
    CloseSSH3 --> CompileStaging[Compile Staging Deploy Summary]
    CompileStaging --> PostStaging[Post Staging Summary to Job Summaries]
    
    PostStaging --> StagingCheck{Staging Deployment Success?}
    StagingCheck -->|No| CleanupStaging[Cleanup & Release Resources]
    CleanupStaging --> Stop5([Stop])
    
    %% Production Approval and Deployment
    StagingCheck -->|Yes| PauseProd[Pause Deploy to Prod Job]
    PauseProd --> RequestApproval[Request ADM Team Approval]
    
    RequestApproval -.-> Note25["`**ADM Approval:**
    - One or more ADM team members
    - Environment protection rules enforced
    - Manual approval required`"]
    
    RequestApproval --> WaitApproval[Wait for ADM Approval]
    WaitApproval --> ApprovalCheck{ADM Approval Received?}
    
    ApprovalCheck -->|No| CancelDeploy[Deployment Cancelled]
    CancelDeploy --> CleanupCancel[Cleanup & Release Resources]
    CleanupCancel --> Stop6([Stop])
    
    ApprovalCheck -->|Yes| GenToken5[Generate New Authentication Token]
    GenToken5 --> CheckoutAuto5[Checkout Reusable Automation Repo]
    CheckoutAuto5 --> RerunProtection[Re-run Environment Protection Check]
    
    RerunProtection -.-> Note26["`**Critical Security Validation:**
    - Verify prod rules not tampered
    - Confirm workflow compliance
    - Critical security validation`"]
    
    RerunProtection --> ProtectionCheck{Protection Check Passes?}
    ProtectionCheck -->|No| ProdFail[Production Deployment Fails]
    ProdFail --> CleanupProdFail[Cleanup & Release Resources]
    CleanupProdFail --> Stop7([Stop])
    
    %% Production Deployment
    ProtectionCheck -->|Yes| CallProdDeploy[Call Deploy Composite Action - Prod]
    CallProdDeploy --> InstallTools5[Install Tech-Specific Tools]
    InstallTools5 --> DownloadArtifacts4[Download, De-archive & Move Artifacts]
    DownloadArtifacts4 --> LoadSSH4[Load SSH Private Keys from Secrets]
    LoadSSH4 --> EstabSSH4[Establish SSH Connection to Production Server]
    
    EstabSSH4 -.-> Note27["`**SSH Connection to Production Environment:**
    - Highest security standards
    - Encrypted connections only
    - Audit trail for all operations
    - Zero-trust authentication`"]
    
    %% Production Environment Operations
    subgraph ProdEnv ["🚀 Production Environment Operations"]
        direction TB
        ValidatePrereq4[Validate Deployment Prerequisites]
        VerifyCert[Verify Deployment Certification]
        CreateBackup4[Create Application Backup]
        TransferPkg4[Transfer Deployment Package]
        PrepareEnv4[Prepare Deployment Environment]
        DeployApp4[Deploy Application]
        StartApp4[Start Application]
        VerifyDeploy4[Verify Deployment]
        RunSmoke4[Run Smoke Tests]
        WarmUp4[Warm Up Application]
        HealthCheck4[Perform Health Checks]
        UpdateStatus4[Update Deployment Status]
        PostCleanup4[Post Deployment Cleanup]
        CloseSSH4[Close SSH Connection]
    end
    
    EstabSSH4 --> ValidatePrereq4
    ValidatePrereq4 --> VerifyCert
    VerifyCert --> CreateBackup4
    CreateBackup4 -.-> Note28[Critical production backup via SSH]
    CreateBackup4 --> TransferPkg4
    TransferPkg4 -.-> Note29[Secure production file transfer]
    TransferPkg4 --> PrepareEnv4
    PrepareEnv4 --> DeployApp4
    DeployApp4 -.-> Note30[Remote deployment execution]
    DeployApp4 --> StartApp4
    StartApp4 --> VerifyDeploy4
    VerifyDeploy4 --> RunSmoke4
    RunSmoke4 -.-> Note31[Production validation tests]
    RunSmoke4 --> WarmUp4
    WarmUp4 --> HealthCheck4
    HealthCheck4 -.-> Note32[Critical health monitoring]
    HealthCheck4 --> UpdateStatus4
    UpdateStatus4 --> PostCleanup4
    PostCleanup4 --> CloseSSH4
    CloseSSH4 -.-> Note33[Secure connection termination]
    
    CloseSSH4 --> CompileProd[Compile Prod Deploy Summary]
    CompileProd --> PostProd[Post Prod Summary to Job Summaries]
    
    %% Final Cleanup and Summary
    PostProd --> ExecSummary[Execute Workflow Summary Job]
    ExecSummary --> CompileComp[Compile Comprehensive Summary]
    
    CompileComp -.-> Note34["`**Comprehensive Summary:**
    - Easy to read summary
    - Complete workflow run overview
    - All environment deployment results`"]
    
    CompileComp --> PostFinal[Post Final Summary to Job Summaries]
    
    %% Final Cleanup
    subgraph FinalCleanup ["🧹 Final Cleanup"]
        direction TB
        ClearTemp[Clear Temporary Files]
        UnsetVars[Unset Sensitive Variables]
        CleanWorkspace[Clean Workspace]
        UploadLogs[Upload Final Logs]
        ReleaseRunner[Release Runner Resources]
        DeallocateRunner[Deallocate Runner Instance]
        ArchiveLogs[Archive Complete Workflow Logs]
    end
    
    PostFinal --> ClearTemp
    ClearTemp --> UnsetVars
    UnsetVars --> CleanWorkspace
    CleanWorkspace --> UploadLogs
    UploadLogs --> ReleaseRunner
    ReleaseRunner --> DeallocateRunner
    DeallocateRunner --> ArchiveLogs
    
    ArchiveLogs --> End([End])

